- Fix `HubEdit.py`: enable full marquee + vertex insertion on **Yellow curves**, show a **Per-Point Crease Sharpness Pill (`0% Smooth` <-> `100% Crisp`)**, add **+ Keep / - Exclude SAM click dots** directly on `master.png` for 1-click hole toggling, and show a **Symmetric Ghost Overlay** (`dashed Cyan/Yellow`) so asymmetrical deviations on `Arm_Flare` stand out against a pure mirror plane in 2 seconds!

