- Full `Ctrl+Z` / `Ctrl+Shift+Z` history ring across ALL tabs (`Tracés`, `Forme`, `Finition`, `/edit`), optimistic UI updates (Notion rule: zero waiting on network), top-right Apple-style progress pill (`Saving... -> Saved locally` -> `Synced to Houdini`), and version scrubber (`V_001 .. V_005`) with 1-click `Diff vs Previous`!
